    "TG3 [in text, 7.2 at fc80d72] Two-sided exact p = P(|W+ - mu| >= |w - mu|) (computed as 2 x the smaller tail, capped at 1; equal because the null is symmetric).",
    "TG4 [in text, 7.2 at fc80d72] Ties in |d| are exact floating-point equality.",
